Third-party material:

- tests/fx/ holds small fixtures written for mokei. Their expected counts come from a run of
  tokei 15.0.0 (MIT or Apache-2.0, https://github.com/XAMPPRocky/tokei) used as the oracle;
  no tokei source or data is copied. See tests/SOURCES.md.
- languages.toml is a table written for mokei. tokei is the behavioural reference for how
  lines are classified; its language list is not redistributed here.
- Build-time dependency, not redistributed: mojo-tokenizers (Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/amarbaro/mojo-tokenizers). The Mojo compiler and the max package are
  Modular's and are installed separately under Modular's own terms.
- The --tokens test reads a Qwen2.5 tokenizer.json (Apache-2.0, Alibaba Cloud) from the
  tester's disk; the file is not part of this repository.

